{"version":1,"content":"<html>\n<body><p>更新時間：11:06 2026-11-20 HKT<br/>發佈時間：11:06 2026-11-20 HKT</p>\n<p>發佈時間：11:06 2026-11-20 HKT</p><p>荔枝角青山道嘉名工廠大廈，今（20日）早上10時34分，警方接獲多個報案，指工廈7樓一個露天有簷篷位置起火，其中一名報案人指自己正身在起火單位內，消防接報派出搜救隊到場，並開喉撲救，約15分鐘將火救熄。火警中姓鄭（39歲）男子因吸入濃煙不適，須戴上氧氣罩送往明愛醫院。</p><img alt=\"一男子吸入濃煙不適送院。\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/100/none/65b40a64ac9905976d4cd77c4a5564bd/2026-11/WhatsApp_Image_2026-11-20_at_11_25_49.jpeg\"/><img alt=\"起火位置火光熊熊。網上圖片\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/100/none/0e92c2097f3bed0d088825f6d5a7745a/2026-11/5cd79202-dd24-4c3a-a916-d08893e02f5b.jpg\"/><img alt=\"網上圖片\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/100/none/b902cfe9a36ef37171b751086d3b9f2d/2026-11/a01b1426-b9db-4c1e-85db-477127e17aad.jpg\"/><img alt=\"起火位置火光熊熊。網上圖片\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/100/none/6f8e40319063e752ae8213efe7670d0d/2026-11/f0627d30-32e0-4ffb-8387-d542a79f52d9.jpg\"/><img alt=\"消防升上雲梯撲救。網圖\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/100/none/7b19bafcef075e36540eb830f2079e6d/2026-11/16_3_10.jpg\"/><img alt=\"消防架起雲梯救火。網上圖片\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/100/none/27d40aaf9a513de43485c39086105b77/2026-11/WhatsApp_Image_2026-11-20_at_11_25_42_1_.jpeg\"/><img alt=\"消防架起雲梯射水救火。網上圖片\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/100/none/f77e9ce19928280e2075cc537ea340f8/2026-11/WhatsApp_Image_2026-11-20_at_11_25_42.jpeg\"/><img alt=\"天台噴出濃煙。\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/100/none/040b0a096ef7fb1f0711078456d549fc/2026-11/WhatsApp_Image_2026-11-20_at_11_19_35.jpeg\"/><img alt=\"離遠也見到起火大廈煙霧瀰漫。\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/100/none/9a4d886f829e8dc7c862ef914b33c00c/2026-11/WhatsApp_Image_2026-11-20_at_11_17_54.jpeg\"/><p>上址為7樓一個工作室及平台花園，網上影片所見，起火位置火光熊熊，大廈的頂部噴出濃煙，離遠亦見到火警工廈附近一帶煙霧瀰漫。</p><img alt=\"數十人疏散到地面。楊偉亨攝\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/100/none/210f13c896fc6833379736516d3a44da/2026-11/WhatsApp_Image_2026-11-20_at_11_25_13_1_.jpeg\"/><img alt=\"數十人疏散到地面。楊偉亨攝\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/100/none/7ae30468aba84c1b235777e19fdfc194/2026-11/WhatsApp_Image_2026-11-20_at_11_25_13.jpeg\"/><img alt=\"警員到場調查。楊偉亨攝\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/100/none/4948a0297c6ef4e39c8559e990d92282/2026-11/WhatsApp_Image_2026-11-20_at_11_25_11_1_.jpeg\"/><img alt=\"消防到場救火。楊偉亨攝\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/100/none/c07509fada1e21fde16a494be2b7a3e0/2026-11/WhatsApp_Image_2026-11-20_at_11_25_11.jpeg\"/><img alt=\"數十人疏散到地面。楊偉亨攝\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/100/none/fed18ef7fdb52d676ae5c62a582029a7/2026-11/WhatsApp_Image_2026-11-20_at_11_25_10_1_.jpeg\"/><img alt=\"楊偉亨攝\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/100/none/4b0859d92e8a39141ad990f349701e69/2026-11/WhatsApp_Image_2026-11-20_at_11_25_10.jpeg\"/><p>最Hit</p>\n</body>\n</html>","scraped_at":"2026-11-20T06:03:59.007049+00:00","quality":{"score":1,"chars":278,"images":15,"source":"星島頭條","fallback":"none","origin":"article-html","completeness":"extracted"},"published_at":"2026-11-20T03:06:16+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-11-20T06:57:31.779735+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-11-20T05:57:31.673027+00:00","content_hash":"b479390db38c1e06ad5f3f4477cb0e1cbd543ccea5d25f24dc8e6f4799563b38","evidence_status":"full","scrape_error":null,"content_retention":null,"content_capture":null}